# ─── Setup checklist ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# 1. GOOGLE OAUTH
#    a. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com → APIs & Services → Credentials
#    b. Create an OAuth 2.0 Client ID (Web application)
#    c. Add Authorized redirect URI:
#       https://your-project-id.supabase.co/auth/v1/callback
#    d. In Supabase: Authentication → Providers → Google
#       Paste your Client ID and Client Secret
#
# 2. APPLE SIGN IN
#    a. Go to https://developer.apple.com → Certificates, Identifiers & Profiles
#    b. Create a Services ID and enable Sign In with Apple
#    c. Add redirect URL:
#       https://your-project-id.supabase.co/auth/v1/callback
#    d. In Supabase: Authentication → Providers → Apple
#       Paste your Service ID, Team ID, Key ID, and Private Key
#
# 3. LINKEDIN OAUTH
#    a. Go to https://www.linkedin.com/developers/apps → Create App
#    b. Under Products, add "Sign In with LinkedIn using OpenID Connect"
#    c. Add redirect URL:
#       https://your-project-id.supabase.co/auth/v1/callback
#    d. In Supabase: Authentication → Providers → LinkedIn (OIDC)
#       Paste your Client ID and Client Secret
#
# 4. LOCAL DEVELOPMENT
#    In Supabase: Authentication → URL Configuration
#    Add to "Redirect URLs": http://localhost:5174/auth/callback
#
# 5. PRODUCTION
#    Add to Supabase Redirect URLs: https://yourdomain.com/auth/callback
